	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">Hurricane Warning Issued for 200 Miles of Texas Coast As Tropical Storm Claudette Strengthens</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/11_ds_153873.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/TROPICAL_WEATHER8.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">The National Hurricane Center issued a hurricane warning Monday for more than 200 miles of Texas coastline as Tropical Storm Claudette gathered strength in the Gulf of Mexico.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_153873.asp">Full Story</a>
