	</tr>






	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Cities Are Preparing to Revive Cold War-Era Sirens As Terror Warnings</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Cold War-era sirens may be revived as terrorism warnings. Cities including Oklahoma City, Chicago and Dallas have upgraded their outdoor warning systems with a type of siren that can carry voice announcements - an idea that officials say took on added importance in the post-Sept. 11 world.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_153797.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3">&nbsp;
