	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Talk Show Host Jerry Springer Files Papers to Run for U.S. Senate From Ohio</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Jerry Springer, the talk show host whose nationally syndicated program often spotlighted strippers and skinheads, officially filed papers on Monday to run for the U.S. Senate from Ohio.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_153764.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
