	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">N.Y. Times Names Bill Keller New Executive Editor More Than a Month After Plagiarism Scandal</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/11_ds_153476.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/NY_TIMES_EDITOR.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">The New York Times on Monday named Bill Keller as executive editor, more than a month after the newspaper's top editors resigned following a plagiarism scandal.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_153476.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
