	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Dow Soars 142, Nasdaq Rises 37 As Wall Street Advances on Strong Bank Earnings, Intel Upgrade</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Better-than-expected profits from Citigroup and Bank of America powered Wall Street higher Monday as investors grew increasingly confident of a strong economic rebound. A brokerage upgrade of Intel also boosted stocks.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_153862.asp">Full Story</a>
