		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Esteban Loaiza of Chicago White Sox and Giants' Jason Schmidt Are All-Star Starting Pitchers</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Esteban Loaiza of the host Chicago White Sox and Jason Schmidt of the San Francisco Giants were picked as the starting pitchers for Tuesday night's All-Star game.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_153630.asp">Full Story</a>
